    <string name="settings_reverse_order_desc">By default Android galleries treat the first item, at the top, as the most recent, and you browse backwards. Turn this on for file-manager ordering: from the oldest to the most recent.</string>
    <!-- The switch that decides what deleting means, and with it whether a confirmation
         appears: the two go together, because you get asked exactly when there is no way
         back. The Italian wording is the user's, dictated word for word. -->
